[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-mtn-foundation-scholarship-for-blind-students-mtnf-sbs-2026-189":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},189,"mtn-foundation-scholarship-for-blind-students-mtnf-sbs-2026-189","Mtn Foundation Scholarship For Blind Students (mtnf Sbs) 2026","\u003Cp>MTN Foundation Scholarship 2026 is a unique opportunity aimed at supporting high-performing Nigerian students in science and technology-related fields.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>MTN Foundation Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: MTN Foundation \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: \u003Cstrong>₦300,000 Annually\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>About the MTN Foundation Scholarship for Blind Students (MTNF SBS) 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The MTN Foundation also offers the \u003Cstrong>MTN Foundation Scholarship for Blind Students (MTNF SBS) 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>, a unique initiative aimed at supporting visually impaired students in Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Each year, hundreds of students are selected based on academic excellence and consistency.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This MTN Scholarship ensures that students with disabilities have \u003Cstrong>equal access to quality \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fmtn-foundation-scholarship-for-blind-student\u002F#\">\u003Cstrong> \u003Cu>education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong> and financial support\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>2026 MTN Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦300,000 annual grant\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Financial support for tuition and study materials\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Encouragement for academic continuity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Available Programmes for MTN SBS Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The MTN SBS Scholarship is open to students pursuing degrees in the following field;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Science including Medicine\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Technology\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mathematics\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Participating Universities for the MTN Blind Students Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Since its inception in 2012, the MTN Foundation Scholarship for Blind Students (MTN SBS) has been supporting eligible blind students in 200 and 300-level courses across Nigerian Public Tertiary Institutions, including\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Universities,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Polytechnics, and\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Colleges of \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fmtn-foundation-scholarship-for-blind-student\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Scholarship application guides\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Requirements for MTN Foundation Scholarship for Blind Students 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate and postgraduate Shanghai Government Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be Nigerian students in Nigerian Public Tertiary Institutions (Universities, Polytechnics, and Colleges of Education).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a 200 &amp; 300 level student\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be pursuing any course in an accredited institution.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a visually-impared (blind) student\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>However, for blind students studying Law, which is a 5 years course, only 300 level students can apply for the MTN Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Blind Students in the Universities or Colleges of Education must have a minimum Cumulative Grade Point Average (CGPA) of 2.5\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Blind Students in Public Polytechnics must have a minimum Cumulative Grade Point Average (CGPA) of 2.0 from the Ordinary National Diploma (OND) Program and must have secured admission into the Higher National Diploma (HND) Program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 MTN SBS Scholarships, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical certificate confirming visual impairment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Admission letter\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Student ID\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic results\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for MTN Foundation Scholarship for Blind Students (SBS) 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the MTN Foundation Scholarship for Blind Students (SBS), follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Select SBS category\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill in application details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upload required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit application\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>NB: \u003C\u002Fstrong>Ensure your \u003Cstrong>medical documentation is valid, \u003C\u002Fstrong>Maintain consistent academic performance, and Double-check your application before submission\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Ca class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.mtn.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Click Here To Apply\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Ca class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fapi.whatsapp.com\u002Fsend?text=APPLY%20FOR%20THIS%20POST%20https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fmtn-foundation-scholarship-for-blind-student\u002F\">Share This Scholarship\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Apply here: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.mtn.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.mtn.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-04-29 12:26:16",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmtn-foundation-scholarship-for-blind-students-mtnf-sbs-2026\u002F69f1ead7f283f3.95745822_screenshot 2026-04-29 121702.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fasset